Everything's ready on my end — the switch itself is the one step only you can do, inside ArtCraft.

**To apply it, paste this code into ArtCraft's theme settings:**
```
SM2-0E1A2E-070B14-v-00E5FF-50-soft
```

Readability check: **passes WCAG AA** — no shortfalls. The guard did one thing worth knowing: it deepened your cyan accent from `#00E5FF` to `#008391` so button labels stay readable. Buttons will pop a bit less, but all text is safe.

